== Icelandic ==
=== Etymology===
From ''[[leika]]'' meaning "to [[play]]" + the reflexive pronoun ''[[sér]]'', which is the {{dat}} form of ''[[sig]]'' meaning "[[oneself]]".
=== Verb ===

'''leika sér'''

# to [[play]]
#: ''Börnin eru að '''leika sér'''.''
#:: The children are '''playing'''.

